st over three weeks after the  governor closed bars and gyms  again here's the governor doug ducey  there's no  victory lap today there's there's no  celebration  okay we cannot let up  you know florida set a single day record  for the number of deaths yesterday and  so did california the cdc is now saying  that over the next four weeks the states  with the greatest likelihood for a large  number of deaths  are the following i want to read them to  you alabama georgia  idaho nevada oklahoma south carolina  texas utah and right here in florida  tony it's a longer list than we would  like david begnoforce david thank you  very much
 

